    "Use iris-metal 0.3.x, 0.5.x or 0.6.x with this app. Quit Iris before changing the engine. Install the chosen release into a new Python environment, then select its bin/iris-metal here. Keep the old environment until the new one works; select the old path again to roll back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use iris-metal 0.3.x, 0.5.x or 0.6.x with this app. Quit Iris before changing the engine. Install the chosen release into a new Python environment, then select its bin/iris-metal here. Keep the old environment until the new one works; select the old path again to roll back."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このアプリにはiris-metal 0.3.x、0.5.xまたは0.6.xを使用してください。エンジンを変更する前にIrisを終了します。新しいPython環境に目的のリリースをインストールし、そのbin/iris-metalをここで選択してください。動作を確認するまで旧環境を残しておくと、以前のパスを再選択して元に戻せます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
